  family + a6=a5                     P(eps==0) = 9.956e-05   COLLAPSED
  shifted a5=a6, e9=e10=-1           P(eps==0) = 2.543e-07   full 32-bit
  TRIPLE a4=a5=a6, e8=e9=e10=-1      P(eps==0) = 1.016e-04   COLLAPSED
